# Bot1 gains control of the Bears (CR 603.2, 202.3) for as long as that Aura is attached to it (CR 611.2b). Eriette attacks
# with lifelink: Bot2 16, Bot1 24. Turn 4: Bot2 Disenchants the Pacifism, and the Bears return to Bot2.

